T*
(SDS_80-15-9 PAGE 2 OF 4 - INCOMPATIBLE MATERIALS & CONTAMINATION HAZARDS) Tj
T*
(- Strictly Incompatible Substances: Strong mineral acids \(H2SO4 above controlled 180 ppmw catalytic setpoint\), transition metal salts \(iron, rust, copper, cobalt, lead\), brass, and fibrous silicate insulation.) Tj
T*
(- Material Compatibility Rule: Only passivated 316L Stainless Steel \(SA-240 316L\) or glass-lined equipment is permitted in Unit 2300 \(V-2301, P-2301A/B, D-2304, E-2307\).) Tj
T*
